  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Development: Dairy Modernisation and Market Access Project (DiMMA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DiMMA&apos;s goal is rural economic development and poverty reduction by contributing to modernization and the emergence of a competitive, diversified, resilient and sustainable dairy industry. The development objective is to enhance the livelihoods and resilience of smallholder dairy producers, especially in mountainous areas, and improve the management of the natural resources on which they depend</narrative>
  </description>
